{"schema_version":1,"id":"018f0000-0000-7000-8000-00000000c66d","stream":{"kind":"session","id":"01a0b328-b328-7981-8beb-18f071df4b5f"},"sequence":401,"recorded_at":1780531400000797,"record_type":"event","durability":"durable","causation_id":"8855960a-8895-4077-a9ec-0cb17e90819e","payload_type":"task.lifecycle.output","payload_schema_version":1,"payload":{"kind":"task_lifecycle","command_id":"8855960a-8895-4077-a9ec-0cb17e90819e","run_stream":{"kind":"run","id":"8855960a-8895-4077-a9ec-0cb17e90819e"},"task_stream":{"kind":"task","id":"01a0b329-a1b2-70e3-a3ee-b6e8886de074"},"task_id":"01a0b329-a1b2-70e3-a3ee-b6e8886de074","event":{"kind":"output","task_id":"01a0b329-a1b2-70e3-a3ee-b6e8886de074","chunk":"Read text file `/Users/iv/Developer/ReluxWorks/agent-session-manager/.task-board/.resources/TASK-260830-2g5be6/TASK-260830-2g5be6_results.md`.\n1|# TASK-260830-2g5be6 Results — implement-native-capture-and-source-race-check (rev3)\n2|\n3|Status: ready for review. Candidate left UNCOMMITTED in the Story\n4|worktree (`task-board/story/STORY-260830-1cyj0q`) on the predecessor\n5|checkpoint `2f844bb` (Story branch over trunk `a12d1bd`); no commit\n6|on the Story branch. `origin/main` is `c3aae73` at handoff, unchanged\n7|since spawn, so no `refresh-candidate` ran.\n8|\n9|Revision 3 answers review RUN-260918-fdce92 (CHANGES REQUESTED on\n10|rev2): production was correct on all 36 probes; the block was the\n11|evidence contract — the published 17-of-17 member-level ratio\n12|measured 15 of 17 (row 8 sealed unstable pre/post digests unpinned,\n13|row 10 seal-before-gate unpinned at `CaptureAndProject`), plus four\n14|P3 sub-class/attribution items. This rework is two strengthened\n15|tests, three new tests, nine new harness rows, and TRACEABILITY\n16|attribution fixes. No production logic changed: the only production\n17|edit is the `project.go` ORDER-PIN comment, whose \"and on any\n18|emitted receipt blob\" clause was inert (that plant never emits a\n19|receipt) and now states the seal-error kill plus the new seal row.\n20|\n21|## Delivered (rev1 scope, unchanged)\n22|\n23|`internal/clonesnap` implements the capture operation over a real\n24|on-disk provider store (second leaf of STORY-260830-1cyj0q):\n25|contained walk through the `secprim` Guard, nine-class\n26|classification with always-excluded bytes never opened, Capture\n27|Boundary from measured evidence, the source-race gate before any\n28|seal or projection output, workspace checkpoint + source head from\n29|observed state, Section 10.2 descriptors with `capability_unavailable`\n30|past 128 GiB, and target admission through the landed G2 and\n31|maximal-safe gates. Every artifact seals through the landed\n32|`clonebundle` builders and re-decodes before publish or return; no\n33|second model exists. No `ax` CLI, provider process, or network; no\n34|`internal/traceability` edit (FINAL leaf carries bindings + re-pin).\n35|\n36|## Finding-by-finding rework table (rev2 verdict → rev3 change)\n37|\n38|| Finding | Change | Test that fails without it | Evidence path |\n39||---|---|---|---|\n40|| P2-α Row 8 (sealed unstable pre/post digests unpinned; `R2-unstable-seals-pre-as-post` SURVIVED) | `TestCaptureArchiveSealsUnstable` now asserts the SEALED boundary's `pre_capture_digest == result.PreDigest`, `post_capture_digest == result.PostDigest`, and sealed `source_generation == request.Generation` (decoded `CaptureBoundary` fields) | Same test FAILs under `N-unstable-seals-pre-as-post` (`race_test.go:168: sealed post_capture_digest = sha256:7113…, measured post = \"sha256:d7e2…\"`) | `mutants/run1/N-unstable-seals-pre-as-post.log`, `mutants/run2/N-unstable-seals-pre-as-post.log` (`# exit=1`, `--- FAIL: TestCaptureArchiveSealsUnstable`) |\n41|| P2-α Row 10 (\"before any seal\" pinned at `Capture` but not at `CaptureAndProject`; `R2-project-seal-before-gate` SURVIVED) | `TestCaptureRaceEmitsNoReceipt` now scans the CAPTURE store for any decodable raw or capture manifest, the way `TestCaptureRaceSealsNoManifest` does | Same test FAILs under `N-race-order-project-seal` (`race_test.go:258: mutated capture sealed a raw manifest before the race gate`); `N-race-order-project` stays KILLED by the seal error message (`misses \"source mutated during capture\"`) | `mutants/run1/N-race-order-project-seal.log`, `mutants/run2/N-race-order-project-seal.log` (`# exit=1`); `N-race-order-project.log` shows the seal-error kill |\n42|| P3-a (unplanned SPECIAL member unmeasured) | New `TestCaptureRefusesUnplannedSpecialMember`: an unplanned symlink `stray-link` to an outside secret refuses `not a plan candidate` naming the member, with no outside byte installed and zero blobs | Same test FAILs under `N-unplanned-special` (plant treats exactly `stray-link` as an intermediate; capture seals stable) | `mutants/run1/N-unplanned-special.log`, `mutants/run2/N-unplanned-special.log` (`# exit=1`) |\n43|| P3-b (symlinked STORE root unmeasured) | New `TestCaptureRefusesSymlinkedStoreRoot`: refusal names `link-root` and `symlink`; zero blobs installed | Same test FAILs under `N-store-root-symlink` (narrowing keyed on the link name: follows the trailing link for exactly `link-root`, every other symlinked root still refuses) | `mutants/run1/N-store-root-symlink.log`, `mutants/run2/N-store-root-symlink.log` (`# exit=1`) |\n44|| P3-c (excluded-member size claim untested) | Shipped the row (not the reword): new `TestCaptureRaceExcludedSizeChange` — the excluded `store/token-cache` size change refuses naming the member | Same test FAILs under `N-excluded-size` (exactly `store/token-cache` contributes a constant size; capture seals stable) | `mutants/run1/N-excluded-size.log`, `mutants/run2/N-excluded-size.log` (`# exit=1`) |\n45|| P3-d (branch bound credited to the local check) | TRACEABILITY 1.6 row now states the measured gate is the landed `DecodeWorkspaceBinding` and the local `workspaceNullableText` is defence in depth | Behaviour pinned at the entry by `TestCheckpointWorkspaceM