yFingerprints/BadDigest/BadWorkspaceID`, `TestCaptureSealsBothManifestsFromStoreBytes` | `N-workspace-fingerprints`, `N-fingerprints-129` (NEW, local `maximum is 128` literal) |\n68|| 12 | `TestCheckpointWorkspaceRefusesEscape/DotSegments/MissingCwd/FileCwd/SymlinkRoot` | `N-workspace-cwd` (defence-in-depth, message-keyed) |\n69|| 13 | `TestCaptureExternalNativeBasis`, `TestCaptureRefusesMixedSourceBasis/UnknownBasisKind/UnsanitizedExternalRef/InvalidSourceIdentity` | entry re-validation pinned by `TestCaptureRefusesInvalidSourceIdentity` (five undecodable identities, no manifest published); basis grammar refusals asserted literally at the entry |\n70|| 14 | `TestCaptureInstallsEveryPayloadBlob`, crash replay assertion in `TestCaptureCrashChildSelfTerminates`, `TestProjectIsIdempotent`, `TestCaptureHookFires` | `N-payload-install-blob-b`, `N-hook-crash` |\n71|| 15 | `TestCaptureEmptyMemberSealsEmptyBlob/MultiChunkMember/DescriptorAgreementEndToEnd/RefusesOversizedMember/RefusesSparseOversizedMember`, `TestDefaultMaxSingleBytesIs128GiB` | `N-descriptor-empty`, `N-descriptor-offset`, `N-first-chunk-oversize` (NEW), `N-oversize` |\n72|| 16 | `TestCaptureLogRecordsDigestsOnly`, `TestCaptureExcludesSecrets` (log + error scan) | `N-log-leak`, `N-excluded-orphan-blob` (add-write) |\n73|| 17 | `TestProjectAdmitsStableEveryProfile`, `TestProjectRefusesUnknownProfile` | `N-fidelity` |\n74|\n75|Ratio: **17 of 17 AC rows driven and measured at the member\n76|level** — every row's named members are reached by a committed test\n77|through the production call site the matrix names, and every row's\n78|gate carries at least one narrowing the battery reddens 2/2. (Rows\n79|8 and 10 are the two this round closed; rows 2, 3, 9, 11, 15 each\n80|gained a sub-class narrowing.)\n81|\n82|## Inherited advisories (unchanged from rev2)\n83|\n84|- P3-ε: CLOSED here (excluded unknown test + cross-package row).\n85|- P3-ζ: DEFERRED to TASK-260830-32ypr2 (no text admission site).\n86|- P3-η: PART