lob is at most 128 GiB.\\nA larger file MUST fail capture with <code>capability_unavailable</code> before\\npublishing a partial manifest.\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1211,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 303,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
